### SharePoker API 测试

### 1. 测试服务器状态
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### 2. 上传第一个玩家的手牌（使用图片URL或Base64）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "player1",
	"image": "https://example.com/hands/player1.png"
}

### 3. 上传第二个玩家的手牌（使用Base64图片）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "player2",
	"image": "data:image/png;base64,"
}

### 4. 上传第三个玩家的手牌（覆盖上传）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "player3",
	"image": "https://example.com/hands/player3.png"
}

### 5. 查看牌局信息
GET http://localhost:3001/api/game/123456

### 6. 更新玩家1的手牌（测试覆盖功能）
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "123456",
	"username": "player1",
	"image": "https://example.com/hands/player1_new.png"
}

### 7. 再次查看牌局信息（验证更新）
GET http://localhost:3001/api/game/123456

### 8. 创建另一个牌局
POST http://localhost:3001/api/game/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"game_code": "789012",
	"username": "alice",
	"image": "https://example.com/hands/alice.png"
}

### 9. 查看第二个牌局
GET http://localhost:3001/api/game/789012

### 10. 测试不存在的牌局
GET http://localhost:3001/api/game/999999
